CSLib is supported by strategic organizations that pursue long-term visions and roadmaps.
Strategic organizations collaborate actively with [CSLib's governance](/governance) to support CSLib effectively.
You can read more about them below.

# CSLib Initiative

A programme by [Renaissance Philanthropy](https://www.renaissancephilanthropy.org) whose mission is to support the growth of the CSLib open-source project, providing funding, staffing, coordination, and strategic focus.

Read more on the [CSLib Initiative](/initiative) page.

# FORM: Centre for Formal Methods and Future Computing

FORM is the first research centre focused on the development of CSLib, hosted by the [Danish Institute for Advanced Study, University of Southern Denmark](https://www.sdu.dk/form). Its mission is to unlock the large-scale application of formal methods in software development.

Read more on the [FORM](/form) page.
